We raised the question of whether an insertor needs to be added to the bend, but Minta replied that it is not necessary and has already thought of ways to improve it.

When inquiring about the progress  {{2025-07-16}} , Minta replied that there was another problem with hydraulic forming - cracking. The reason is that the wrinkles at the bend are too large, which leads to uneven hydraulic forming. The solution is to add an insertor during bending to eliminate wrinkles.

The insertor will arrive to Minta {{2025-07-17}} and the latest sample ETA is {{2025-07-22}} 



